{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME ABOARD, TRAINEE!! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First things first, sorry about your new job. You\u2019re stuck at Anymart now, doing the most boring gig on Earth. But don\u2019t worry, we got you. We built this totally insane card game to kill the boredom. Even made a leaderboard! The goal? Become the Ultimate Slacker of the Month. What d'you say?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/extras/91c3f1f3f62b90c5cb7546cf5f0251ff.poster.avif?t=1773348626\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/extras/91c3f1f3f62b90c5cb7546cf5f0251ff.webm?t=1773348626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > PICK YOUR HERO. PICK TWO CLANS. SURVIVE THE SHIFT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of every run, you choose <strong>1 Hero</strong> (with a passive power that shapes your whole plan) and <strong>2 Clans</strong> (which decide what cards you\u2019ll see). That\u2019s your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you fight through <strong>twelve rounds of pure chaos</strong>, building a team that actually feels like <i>your</i> creation\u2014because the fun is in discovering what works <strong>this run</strong>, not memorizing a fixed meta.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/extras/d9d7b12e6ae497a074e5f761ca5eddc2.poster.avif?t=1773348626\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/extras/d9d7b12e6ae497a074e5f761ca5eddc2.webm?t=1773348626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RANKED LEADERBOARD: WIN YOUR BREAK. OR LOSE IT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranked</strong> is where it counts: win runs, gain rank, climb the <strong>leaderboard</strong>, and chase that sweet <strong>Ultimate Slacker</strong> title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to chill? Jump in for quick sessions,\u00a0<strong>easy to pick up, easy to put down</strong>, dangerously \u201cone more run\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/extras/dd32c6a2fde2a8e62a35fd816606a036.poster.avif?t=1773348626\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/extras/dd32c6a2fde2a8e62a35fd816606a036.webm?t=1773348626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/extras/dd32c6a2fde2a8e62a35fd816606a036.mp4?t=1773348626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INSANE SYNERGIES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alright, let\u2019s talk cards for a sec. Toilet paper. Slow cooker. You name it. We turned every store product into EPIC WARRIORS! And now they\u2019ve got some seriously crazy synergies. Example: you\u2019ve got a Level 3 Plastimorph and a Therapist on the field? Boom! Your Therapist triggers their power twice during battle. Don\u2019t get it yet? No worries. Let\u2019s play a round, you\u2019ll get it real quick. Ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/extras/3e074be9134846d991a3830a589f7736.poster.avif?t=1773348626\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/extras/3e074be9134846d991a3830a589f7736.webm?t=1773348626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVERYTHING IS A WEAPON (YES, EVEN THAT)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toilet paper. Slow cooker. Mystery produce. We turned every store product into <strong>battle-ready weirdos</strong> with combos you\u2019ll stumble into and immediately want to abuse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Example: Got a <strong>Level 3 Plastimorph</strong> and a <strong>Therapice Cream</strong> on the field? Congrats, your <strong>Therapice Cream</strong> will trigger their power at least twice during battle which might help you win the fight!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t fully get it yet? Perfect. Play one run. You will.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3002240?t=1773348626","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/c9329a8d5dd2af4de468f7c749efb8972bb607d1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773348626","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/71085b302484a6b7b0d054d399f27604f2e04fcb/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1773348626","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002240/71085b302484a6b7b0d054d399f27604f2e04fcb/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1773348626","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4005910,"description":""}],"detai